<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Diak — Local AI, Native Mac Control</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080a10;
      --panel: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      --panel-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      --text: #f7f8ff;
      --muted: #a8b0c7;
      --accent: #7c5cff;
      --accent-2: #23d5ab;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(124,92,255,.35), transparent 28rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(35,213,171,.22), transparent 24rem),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #080a10 0%, #0d101a 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 28px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(124,92,255,.45);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 82px 0 64px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr;
      gap: 44px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .pill {
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      color: #dce1ff;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(46px, 7vw, 82px);
      line-height: .93;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
    }

    .lead {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .nonce {
      margin-top: 24px;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(35,213,171,.38);
      background: rgba(35,213,171,.09);
      color: #bfffee;
      font: 700 13px/1.2 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .btn.primary {
      border: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #9b7cff);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(124,92,255,.38);
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--panel-strong), rgba(255,255,255,.045));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .window-bar {
      height: 46px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 18px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ff5f57;
    }

    .dot:nth-child(2) { background: #ffbd2e; }
    .dot:nth-child(3) { background: #28c840; }

    .canvas {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .prompt {
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.28);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: #dbe0ff;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .result {
      margin-top: 16px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .result div {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .result strong { color: var(--text); }

    .features {
      padding: 22px 0 72px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.055);
    }

    .feature h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
    }

    .feature p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 28px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      nav { display: none; }
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 48px; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        Diak
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#canvas">Canvas</a>
        <a href="#start">Start</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <div class="pill">Native Mac AI workflows for builders</div>
          <h1>Your local AI command center.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Diak connects high-trust AI agents to your desktop, files, apps, and creative workflow —
            giving you a fast, visual place to build, review, and ship.
          </p>
          <div class="nonce">DIAK_PROVIDER_CANVAS_20260510-122118_19728</div>
          <div class="actions" id="start">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#">Open Diak Canvas</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#features">See what it does</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" id="canvas" aria-label="Diak Canvas preview">
          <div class="window-bar">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span class="dot"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas">
            <div class="prompt">
              “Turn this rough idea into a shippable product plan, prototype, and QA checklist.”
            </div>
            <div class="result">
              <div><strong>Plan:</strong> Scope, milestones, risks, and launch path.</div>
              <div><strong>Build:</strong> Agent-assisted coding with local project context.</div>
              <div><strong>Verify:</strong> Browser QA, screenshots, logs, and regression checks.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="features" id="features">
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Canvas-first creation</h3>
          <p>Draft ideas, inspect outputs, and keep visual work organized in one focused surface.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Local provider bridge</h3>
          <p>Run AI workflows against real local tools while keeping control of your environment.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Built for shipping</h3>
          <p>Move from concept to code, QA, packaging, and release with production discipline.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      © 2026 Diak. AI-native desktop workflows for product builders.
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
